<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Prompt for Self-Consistency (SC)</h2>

<figure id="LST1" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 1: </span>Prompt used to generate multiple rationales for self-consistency (SC).</figcaption>
<div id="LST1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
