<div id="lstnumberx44" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx44.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Predicted</span><span id="lstnumberx44.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx44.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Labels</span><span id="lstnumberx44.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:</span><span id="lstnumberx44.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx44.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{</span><span id="lstnumberx44.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">labels</span><span id="lstnumberx44.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">}</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx45" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx45.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">---</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx46" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx47" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx47.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Reasoning</span><span id="lstnumberx47.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx48" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx48.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">---</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx49" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx49.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{</span><span id="lstnumberx49.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">reasoning</span><span id="lstnumberx49.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">}</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx50" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx50.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">---</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx51" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx52" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx52.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Based</span><span id="lstnumberx52.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">on</span><span id="lstnumberx52.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">your</span><span id="lstnumberx52.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">evaluation</span><span id="lstnumberx52.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">,</span><span id="lstnumberx52.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">what</span><span id="lstnumberx52.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">is</span><span id="lstnumberx52.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx52.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">score</span><span id="lstnumberx52.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">for</span><span id="lstnumberx52.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">this</span><span id="lstnumberx52.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">reasoning</span><span id="lstnumberx52.23" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">?</span><span id="lstnumberx52.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Answer</span><span id="lstnumberx52.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">with</span><span id="lstnumberx52.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">a</span><span id="lstnumberx52.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">single</span><span id="lstnumberx52.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">digit</span><span id="lstnumberx52.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx52.35" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">(1-5).</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx53" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx53.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Score</span><span id="lstnumberx53.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:"""</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Annotation Guidelines</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To systematically evaluate the quality of LLM-generated rationales, we recruited three annotators and provided them with detailed guidelines to ensure consistency. Each rationale was evaluated on a 1–5 Likert scale according to three criteria: Logical Consistency, Task Alignment, and Plausibility. Below we describe the definitions, scoring criteria, and illustrative examples for each criterion.</p>
</div>
<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Logical Consistency</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition:</span> Whether the rationale maintains internal consistency without contradictions.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Scoring scale:</span></p>
<ul id="A4.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1 (Very Low):</span> Contains severe contradictions that undermine the entire explanation.</p>
<ul id="A4.I1.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I1.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I1.i1.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: States “this invention is implemented in hardware circuits” but later claims “it operates purely as software.”</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2 (Low):</span> Multiple inconsistencies, illogical flow, difficult to follow.</p>
<ul id="A4.I1.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I1.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I1.i2.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: Key concepts appear disconnected and the reasoning is incoherent.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3 (Medium):</span> Minor inconsistencies or ambiguities, but overall reasoning is still acceptable.</p>
<ul id="A4.I1.i3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I1.i3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I1.i3.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: Early part emphasizes classification algorithms, later shifts focus to preprocessing, creating mild inconsistency.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4 (High):</span> Mostly consistent with only small logical leaps or minor off-topic additions.</p>
<ul id="A4.I1.i4.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I1.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I1.i4.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: Explanation is coherent around CNN-based classification but ends with a tangential remark.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5 (Very High):</span> Completely consistent, clear logical flow throughout.</p>
<ul id="A4.I1.i5.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I1.i5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I1.i5.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: Clearly explains CNN feature extraction and softmax classification without contradictions.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>Task Alignment</h3>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition:</span> The extent to which the rationale aligns with the predicted CPC code definitions.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Scoring scale:</span></p>
<ul id="A4.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1 (Very Low):</span> Almost entirely unrelated to the CPC code.</p>
<ul id="A4.I2.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I2.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I2.i1.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: For H04L (digital communication), the rationale discusses “pharmaceutical compositions.”</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2 (Low):</span> Largely misaligned, focusing on irrelevant aspects.</p>
<ul id="A4.I2.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I2.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I2.i2.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: For H04L, the rationale only describes “antenna structure” without addressing communication protocols.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3 (Medium):</span> Generally aligned but missing key elements or overly focused on secondary aspects.</p>
<ul id="A4.I2.i3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I2.i3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I2.i3.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: For H04L, discusses signal processing but omits transmission protocol.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4 (High):</span> Well aligned, with only minor irrelevant details.</p>
<ul id="A4.I2.i4.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I2.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I2.i4.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: For H04L, primarily covers protocols and error correction, with slight mention of antenna design.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5 (Very High):</span> Perfectly aligned with CPC definitions and core technical aspects.</p>
<ul id="A4.I2.i5.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I2.i5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I2.i5.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: For H04L, explains “data transmission protocols and error correction methods.”</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.3 </span>Plausibility</h3>

<div id="A4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition:</span> Whether the rationale is technically factual and reasonable within the patent domain.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Scoring scale:</span></p>
<ul id="A4.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1 (Very Low):</span> Clearly unrealistic or factually incorrect.</p>
<ul id="A4.I3.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: Claims “images are classified using tokenization techniques.”</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2 (Low):</span> Implausible or largely inaccurate.</p>
<ul id="A4.I3.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I3.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I3.i2.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: “An encryption patent drastically improves signal transmission speed.”</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3 (Medium):</span> Exaggerated or incomplete, but partially plausible.</p>
<ul id="A4.I3.i3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I3.i3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I3.i3.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: “The neural network achieves nearly perfect accuracy in classification.”</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4 (High):</span> Mostly factual with minor inaccuracies.</p>
<ul id="A4.I3.i4.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I3.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I3.i4.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: “CNN extracts image features and applies additional rule-based filtering.”</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5 (Very High):</span> Fully factual, technically sound, and domain-appropriate.</p>
<ul id="A4.I3.i5.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I3.i5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I3.i5.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Example: “CNN extracts features and softmax computes class probabilities.”</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.4 </span>Annotation Procedure</h3>

<div id="A4.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A4.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Each annotator independently evaluated 500 randomly assigned samples.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For each rationale, scores were assigned for Logical Consistency, Task Alignment, and Plausibility, each on a 1–5 scale.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The final human score for each sample was computed as the average across annotators.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I4.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I4.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Inter-annotator reliability was measured with Krippendorff’s alpha, yielding <math id="A4.I4.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=0.641" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.641</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=0.641</annotation></semantics></math>, indicating acceptable agreement.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</article>
